5,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I'm so excited for our trip! Let's pick somewhere super fun! I want to make sure the money part is easy for everyone this time.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I agree. It would be helpful to have a clear understanding of the total costs before we commit to a destination.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,I just want us all to feel close and happy. I wonder why some of our past trips felt a bit off.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,We should prioritize efficiency. I'm tired of spending half the holiday just getting to and from the destination.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I just want to make sure the place is comfortable. I hope we can find somewhere where I can actually relax.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Toshio, you're always so serious! But I'll check ""What separately booked rooms cost last time"" and ""All-in rates against meals bought separately"" to see about the money!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"I will look into ""Pricing of offshore houses let whole"" and ""Valley inn rates versus urban beds"" to get a sense of the baseline costs.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I'll check ""Time alone in the shared-house year"" and ""How last year's days ran"" to see how we've been interacting.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I'll examine ""Ferry sailings and train time"" and ""Getting around by train and bus"" to minimize wasted travel time.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I'll look at ""Bathing hours and bathroom provision"" and ""Inn mealtimes and room arrangements"" to see if I can handle the setup.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Sakura,,Does anyone else have a secret place they want to go? I'm open to anything as long as it's a blast!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I don't have a specific place in mind yet. I prefer to let the data guide us toward a sustainable choice.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Midori,,I agree with Victoria. Let's see what the research tells us about our group dynamics first.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"As long as we aren't spending two days on a boat or a bus, I'm satisfied.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I just hope... that we can all get along and that I can sleep well.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
