33,2,,status,Sakura,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
34,2,,status,Midori,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Sakura,,Wow! I found out that separate rooms can cost way different amounts for different people! That's not fair at all!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The pricing varies quite a bit. Offshore houses are cheaper per night, but the valley inns are much more expensive, though they include some meals.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Midori,,"It's interesting. Last year we barely saw each other, but in the shared house, some of us felt we had no space to breathe.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The ferry is a problem. It takes two whole days of travel. The train to the valley is much faster.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,The island houses only have one bathroom for everyone... and the inn has everyone sleeping in one room on futons. That sounds... stressful.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, if the houses are cheaper, maybe we should go there? But I also saw that all-in rates make light eaters pay as much as big eaters!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Sakura, that's a valid point. A single bill for a whole building would be more equitable than separate bookings, though.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke, do you think having your own space is more important than being in the same room? I want us to be together, but not crowded.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Midori, the city is the most efficient for movement. You don't have to plan anything because trains run every few minutes.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Midori, I think... I might need a door. The idea of one big room with everyone makes me nervous.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Toshio, a city break sounds like a lot of walking! Will we still be together if we all do our own thing?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, the travel time for the island is indeed excessive. I'm starting to lean away from that option.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Sakura, that's my worry too. If we go to a city and do our own routes, we might end up like last year—not meeting until dinner.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"Efficiency doesn't have to mean isolation, but it does mean we don't waste our limited time waiting for a bus or a ferry.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I'm worried about the island bathrooms. If the water runs cold and there's only one, it'll be a disaster.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
