58,3,,status,Sakura,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
59,3,,status,Midori,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
60,3,1,talk,Sakura,,"Okay, the options are Island, City, or Hot Spring! The island is cheap but the ferry is long. The city is fast but we might be alone!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"The Hot Spring town seems like a middle ground, but the all-in rates might be unfair to some of us.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Midori,,"I'm worried the Hot Spring inn will be too crowded with everyone in one room, but the city might be too lonely.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"The Island is out because of the travel time. The City is the most efficient, but the Hot Spring is also quite fast by train.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,I really don't like the island bathroom or the inn's shared room. The city has doors and no strict timetable.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Daisuke, if you need a door, the city is the best! And @Victoria, we can just pay for our own meals in the city so it's fair!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Sakura, that solves the cost disparity. A city break allows us to know our own spending and avoids the ""all-in"" unfairness.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Midori,,"But will we actually bond? If we have separate rooms and separate routes, are we even on a trip together?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Toshio,,We can still meet for dinner. The important thing is that we don't spend two days of our holiday in transit.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I think... I'd be much happier in the city. I can have my own space to recharge, and I won't be stressed about the bathroom.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Sakura,,"I vote for the City! It's fair with the money, and Daisuke will be happy! We can just make a rule to meet every night!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Victoria,,I agree. The financial transparency of separate bookings and meals in a city is the most rational choice for me. I vote City.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Midori,,"If everyone else is so much more comfortable with the city, I'll agree. Harmony is more important than my fear of loneliness. I vote City.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Toshio,,It is the only logical choice. Minimal travel time and maximum flexibility. I vote City.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I really appreciate you all listening. I feel much better about the city. I vote City.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Sakura,,Yay! We all agree! It's going to be a great city adventure!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Victoria,,It is a relief to have a consensus that satisfies everyone's constraints.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Midori,,I'll look for some lovely restaurants we can all visit together in the evenings.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Toshio,,"Finally, a decision based on efficiency.","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,"Thank you, everyone.","{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
